WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.580
[MUSIC]

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:10.700
The NLM culture I could characterize 
as diverse--lots of opportunities--

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.500
and also very family friendly.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:19.520
The very remarkable thing about NLM is 
the diversity of the workforce in every

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:24.300
sense, you know, whether it's age or their 
professional training or their culture.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:29.260
Here people are very approachable, and if 
you don't mind, you just...even though you

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:34.140
think that, you know, oh they are the Head 
of this department or whatever...you're kind

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:39.500
of afraid of them, but don't be so because I 
found whoever I tried to talk to,

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.700
they seldom turned me down.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:46.300
To me the culture is self-driven, always 
strives for excellence.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:51.080
NLM is full of very hardworking, 
dedicated people who are passionate

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:54.500
about providing biomedical information.

